      <h1 class="text-brand mt-10 flex items-center text-sm font-semibold leading-6">
        Welcome to
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[2rem] mt-4 font-semibold leading-10 tracking-tighter text-zinc-900">
        Incurator
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600">
          Navigate the music industry with confidence, take control of your career, and join the biggest artist community in the world.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4 text-sm leading-5 text-zinc-600">
          <li>
            <strong>Use our cutting-edge AI tools to elevate and manage your career.</strong>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>
              Connect with our human experts to keep growing when you're ready for the next step - brought to you by the Music Funnel.
            </strong>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="flex">
        <div class="w-full sm:w-auto">
          <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/francoabaroa/mic/tree/main/docs"
              class="group relative rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-zinc-900 sm:py-6"
            >
              <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 transition group-hover:bg-zinc-100 sm:group-hover:scale-105">
              </span>
              <span class="relative flex items-center gap-4 sm:flex-col">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="h-6 w-6">
                  <path d="m12 4 10-2v18l-10 2V4Z" fill="#18181B" fill-opacity=".15" />
                  <path
                    d="M12 4 2 2v18l10 2m0-18v18m0-18 10-2v18l-10 2"
                    stroke="#18181B"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                  />
                </svg>
                AI Tools
              </span>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/francoabaroa/mic/tree/main/docs"
              class="group relative rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-zinc-900 sm:py-6"
            >
              <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 transition group-hover:bg-zinc-100 sm:group-hover:scale-105">
              </span>
              <span class="relative flex items-center gap-4 sm:flex-col">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="h-6 w-6">
                  <path
                    stroke="#000000"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M20 4H4v2l6 6v8.5l4-2.5v-6l6-6V4z"
                  />
                </svg>
                Music Funnel
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-700 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <a
                href="https://twitter.com/future_page_of_the_mic_club"
                class="group -mx-2 -my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-2 py-0.5 hover:bg-zinc-50 hover:text-zinc-900"
              >
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                  aria-hidden="true"
